<section id="principles" class="card" aria-labelledby="principles-heading">
  <div class="card-header">
    <h2 id="principles-heading">What we believe</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="card-body">
    <ul class="mb-0">
      <li><strong>Ownership over lock-in.</strong> MIT-licensed, self-hostable; your data stays yours. Managed hosting is a convenience, not a dependency.</li>
      <li><strong>Craft over churn.</strong> One focused product for group management, not four templated products. We’d rather do one thing well.</li>
      <li><strong>Honest numbers.</strong> We report “2 live, 6 evaluating” conservatively and will share member counts only when we can source them from an opt-in mechanism.</li>
      <li><strong>Community warmth.</strong> Artisan, volunteer-led feel — no emoji-as-icons or chip-list AI aesthetic, per project constraints.</li>
    </ul>
